Policy & Safety

At Love Birds, your privacy and relationship memories matter. We keep the app simple, private, and safe for couples and solo users.

1. Your Profile Data

We collect basic profile details such as:

Name
Email address
Profile photo
Relationship start date
Partner preview details if you add a partner manually

Your profile details are used only to show your account, your couple space, widgets, memories, notes, moods, and shared features inside the app.

2. Couple Data

If you connect with a partner, both users may access shared couple data such as:

Memories
Notes
Bucket list
Moods
Places visited
Important dates
Shared widgets

If you are using the app solo, your data stays under your own account and couple space.

3. Partner Preview Data

If your partner has not joined yet, you may add their name or image as preview data.

This preview data is only used inside your app until your partner joins.

Once your partner joins, their real profile data will come from their own account.

4. Profile Updates

When you update your name or profile image, the app updates your user profile.

Your partner may see your updated name and image if you are connected.

5. Disconnecting From Partner

You can disconnect from your partner at any time.

When you disconnect:

Your account is removed from the shared couple connection
Your personal profile is not deleted
Your partner’s profile is not deleted
Shared couple data may remain unless manually deleted

6. Data Security

We use Firebase services to store and protect app data.

Only connected users should be able to access shared couple data. We use Firebase authentication and database rules to help protect your information.

7. What We Do Not Do

We do not sell your personal relationship data.

We do not make your memories public.

We do not allow random users to access your couple space without permission.

8. Images & Media

Profile images and memory images may be uploaded using secure image storage services.

Only users with access to the couple space should be able to view shared images.

9. Account Deletion

You may request to delete your account and personal data.

Deleting your account may remove your profile information, but shared couple content may require separate deletion depending on your connection status.

10. Contact

If you have questions about privacy, safety, data deletion, or account issues, please contact us:

support@lovebirdsapp.com

